o slow-wave bistability or fail to sustain differentiated interactions over time, the theory predicts a drop in consciousness rather than just a hidden normal state.\\\",\n      \\\"parent_ref\\\": null,\n      \\\"score_assessment\\\": {\n        \\\"score\\\": 25,\n        \\\"rationale\\\": \\\"Clearly connects source-grounded state and timing limits to the theory's prediction about reduced Φ.\\\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\nJSON\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
